	(text "3PDT true bypass with input grounding (from the Eagle SwitchPCB, 2022).\nON: input jack -> IN, OUT -> output jack, LED cathode -> GND.\nBYPASS: input jack -> output jack through the BYPASS link; circuit IN shorted to GND.\nJ2-J5 match the pedal boards' 1x4 ribbon header: IN / LED / GND / OUT." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 101.6 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "07ddf2b5-c561-40b4-9bcf-826ea1cd4eef"))
